8-9 is the best opener as it efficiently removes my low singles. It is likely unbeatable given the card history (no 6s available for opponents). This leaves me with a powerful hand of high pairs (10, J, K) and the Rocket, ensuring I can control the game and prevent the Landlord from winning.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥5", "♣6", "♥7", "♦8", "♠9"]}'}
